  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Benin - Access To Financial Services Project: This project aimed to improve the efficiency of financial institutions and micro, small and medium enterprises by increasing access to financial services and improving productivity; strengthened supervision aimed to increase the microfinance institutions&apos; self-sufficiency, decrease portfolios at risk, and increase loans guaranteed with land titles.</narrative>
  </description>
